🦞 Moltbot 2026.1.29 (8ca0b8c) — iMessage green bubble energy, but for everyone.

Usage: moltbot goal [options] [command] [goal]

Plan and execute a high-level goal autonomously

Options:
  --model <id>               Model id (default: claude-sonnet-4-20250514)
  --working-dir <dir>        Working directory for file operations (default:
                             .moltbot-goal-workspace)
  --yes                      Auto-approve plan without prompting (default:
                             false)
  --no-git-checkpoints       Disable git checkpoints during execution
  --json                     Output as JSON (shorthand for --output json)
                             (default: false)
  --dry-run                  Generate and display plan without executing
                             (default: false)
  --plan-only                Generate and persist a plan, then stop before
                             execution (default: false)
  --scout-timeout <minutes>  Scout timeout in minutes (default: 20)
  --diagram <mode>           Diagram format: none, ascii, mermaid, both
                             (default: both for md, none for json)
  --output <format>          Output format: md, json (default: md)
  --backend <backend>        Execution backend: pi, codex, claude_code (default:
                             claude_code)
  --claude-code-auth <mode>  Claude Code auth: subscription, api_key (default:
                             subscription)
  -h, --help                 display help for command

Commands:
  list                       List all goal runs
  status                     Show concise goal status (state, progress, blocker,
                             retries)
  detail                     Show detailed goal status (state, progress,
                             blocker, retries, all steps)
  resume                     Resume a blocked or interrupted goal run
  answer                     Provide input to unblock a goal run
  stop                       Stop a running goal execution

Examples:
  moltbot goal "Create a REST API with Express"
    Plan and build a project
  moltbot goal "Add a README to the current repo" --yes
    Auto-approve plan
  moltbot goal "Refactor auth module" --dry-run
    Preview plan only
  moltbot goal "Build landing page" --dry-run --diagram mermaid
    Mermaid diagram only
  moltbot goal "Build landing page" --dry-run --output json
    JSON output
  moltbot goal list
    List all goal runs
  moltbot goal status <runId>
    Show concise status: state, progress, blocker, retries
  moltbot goal detail <runId>
    Show detailed status with full plan steps
  moltbot goal resume <runId>
    Resume a blocked/interrupted run
  moltbot goal stop <runId>
    Stop a running goal
  moltbot goal answer <runId> --key <KEY> --value <VALUE>
    Answer a blocked run's question

